:"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["mantian-q-fca9837992c73b9f27e2"]},"ordering_evidence":"mantian-q-fca9837992c73b9f27e2","source_order":[26,281,145],"order":5246},{"id":"mantian-e-p161","title":"张华请秀长史河间王署遇害","accounts":[{"id":"mantian-a-98f27928372db441d3bc","label":"裴注·荀绰《冀州记》","text":"张华请秀长史河间王署遇害","evidence":["mantian-q-2552c4112bd395770173"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0111","role":"请秀为长史","evidence":["mantian-q-2552c4112bd395770173"]},{"person":"mantian-p0007","role":"河间王、以秀为平北将军假节","evidence":["mantian-q-2552c4112bd395770173"]},{"person":"luxun-p0085","role":"稍迁至尚书、在冯翊遇害、世人玩其辞赋惜其材干","evidence":["mantian-q-2552c4112bd395770173"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["mantian-q-2552c4112bd395770173"]},"ordering_evidence":"mantian-q-2552c4112bd395770173","source_order":[26,281,187],"order":5247},{"id":"luxun-e-p018d","title":"司马颖攻洛以陆机督军陆云作赋","accounts":[{"id":"luxun-e-p018d-account","label":"《机云别传》","text":"成都王与长沙王构隙攻洛，以陆机督王粹牵秀诸军，陆云作南征赋。","evidence":["luxun-e-p018d-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"luxun-p0082","role":"举兵","evidence":["luxun-e-p018d-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0076","role":"督军","evidence":["luxun-e-p018d-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0084","role":"领军","evidence":["luxun-e-p018d-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0085","role":"领军","evidence":["luxun-e-p018d-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0110","role":"作赋","evidence":["luxun-e-p018d-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文未明示时间","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["luxun-e-p018d-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"luxun-e-p018d-q","source_order":[58,455,"P018d"],"order":10416},{"id":"luxun-e-p018h","title":"牵秀孟玖谮陆机司马颖收杀陆氏兄弟","accounts":[{"id":"luxun-e-p018h-account","label":"《机云别传》","text":"牵秀等与孟玖谮陆机，司马颖信之，收陆机陆云陆耽，皆伏法。","evidence":["luxun-e-p018h-q"]},{"id":"luxun-a-p018-comment","label":"《机云别传》","text":"别传称陆氏兄弟无罪被夷，并引人以陆抗诛及婴孩说报应；这些是该书评述，非客观因果。","evidence":["luxun-q-p018-comment"]},{"id":"luxun-a-p018-letter","label":"孙惠致朱诞书（《机云别传》所载）","text":"孙惠致朱诞书以马援择君为比，叹三陆相携暴朝杀身伤名。","evidence":["luxun-q-p018-letter"]}],"participants":[{"person":"luxun-p0085","role":"谮毁","evidence":["luxun-e-p018h-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0086","role":"谮毁","evidence":["luxun-e-p018h-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0082","role":"令收","evidence":["luxun-e-p018h-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0076","role":"被杀","evidence":["luxun-e-p018h-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0110","role":"被杀","evidence":["luxun-e-p018h-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0088","role":"被杀","evidence":["luxun-e-p018h-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文未明示时间","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["luxun-e-p018h-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"luxun-e-p018h-q","source_order":[58,455,"P018h"],"order":10420}],"persons":[{"id":"luxun-p0085","name":"牵秀","evidence":["luxun-q-p018","mantian-q-3e940fb057fddf197cad","mantian-q-1d64da8522c0ce621bb3","mantian-q-fca9837992c73b9f27e2","mantian-q-2552c4112bd395770173"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"luxun-m-p018-luxun-p0085","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-p018"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-e-p018d-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-20b860773c1dd9d264dc","layer":"pei","quote":"无几而与长沙王构隙，遂举兵攻洛。以机行后将军，督王粹、牵秀等诸军二十万；士龙著《南征赋》以美其事。","attribution":"《机云别传》","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d3a7d3771e82327ad7c0","start":212,"end":261,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-e-p018h-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-20b860773c1dd9d264dc","layer":"pei","quote":"及牵秀等谮机于颖，以为持两端；玖又构之于内：颖信之。遣收机，并收云及弟耽，并伏法。","attribution":"《机云别传》","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d3a7d3771e82327ad7c0","start":365,"end":406,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-p018","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-20b860773c1dd9d264dc","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞景弟机，字士衡；云，字士龙。《机云别传》曰：“晋太康末，俱入洛，造司空张华。华一见而奇之，曰：‘伐吴之役，利在获二俊。’遂为之延誉，荐之诸公。太傅杨骏辟机为祭酒。转太子洗马，尚书著作郎。云为吴王郎中令。出宰浚仪，甚有惠政，吏民怀之，生为立祠。后并历显位。机天才绮练，文藻之美，独冠于时。云亦善属文，清新不及机，而口辩持论，过之。于时朝廷多故，机、云并自结于成都王颖。颖用机为平原相，云清河内史。寻转云右司马，甚见委仗。无几而与长沙王构隙，遂举兵攻洛。以机行后将军，督王粹、牵秀等诸军二十万；士龙著《南征赋》以美其事。机，吴人，羇旅单宦；顿居群士之右，多不厌服。机屡战失利，死散过半。初，宦人孟玖，颖所嬖幸，乘宠预权。云数言其短，颖不能纳；玖又从而毁之。是役也，玖弟超，亦领众配机，不奉军令。机绳之以法，超宣言曰‘陆机将反’。及牵秀等谮机于颖，以为持两端；玖又构之于内：颖信之。遣收机，并收云及弟耽，并伏法。机兄弟既江南之秀，亦著名诸夏；并以无罪夷灭，天下痛惜之。机文章为世所重，云所著亦传于世。初，抗之克步阐也，诛及婴孩。识道者尤之曰：‘后世必受其殃！’及机之诛，三族无遗。孙惠与朱诞书曰：‘马援择君，凡人所闻。不意三陆，相携暴朝；杀身伤名，可为悼叹！’”事亦并在《晋书》。","attribution":"《机云别传》及裴注","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d3a7d3771e82327ad7c0","start":0,"end":540,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-p018-comment","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-20b860773c1dd9d264dc","layer":"pei","quote":"机兄弟既江南之秀，亦著名诸夏；并以无罪夷灭，天下痛惜之。机文章为世所重，云所著亦传于世。初，抗之克步阐也，诛及婴孩。识道者尤之曰：‘后世必受其殃！’及机之诛，三族无遗。","attribution":"《机云别传》","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d3a7d3771e82327ad7c0","start":406,"end":490,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-p018-letter","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-20b860773c1dd9d264dc","layer":"pei","quote":"孙惠与朱诞书曰：‘马援择君，凡人所闻。不意三陆，相携暴朝；杀身伤名，可为悼叹！’","attribution":"孙惠致朱诞书（《机云别传》所载）","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d3a7d3771e82327ad7c0","start":490,"end":530,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-1d64da8522c0ce621bb3","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-dde10bd46d8f983c023a","layer":"pei","quote":"与帝舅黄门侍郎王恺，素相轻侮。恺讽司隶荀恺，令都官诬奏秀‘夜在道中，载高平国守士田兴妻’","attribution":"裴注·荀绰《冀州记》","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aeaedf6f24d38daee210","start":100,"end":144,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-2552c4112bd395770173","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-dde10bd46d8f983c023a","layer":"pei","quote":"后张华请为长史。稍迁至尚书。河间王以秀为平北将军，假节，在冯翊遇害。世人玩其辞赋，惜其材干","attribution":"裴注·荀绰《冀州记》","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aeaedf6f24d38daee210","start":187,"end":232,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-3e940fb057fddf197cad","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-dde10bd46d8f983c023a","layer":"pei","quote":"弱冠得美名，于太康中为卫瓘、崔洪、石崇等所提携，以新安令、博士为司空从事中郎","attribution":"裴注·荀绰《冀州记》","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aeaedf6f24d38daee210","start":61,"end":99,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-fca9837992c73b9f27e2","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-dde10bd46d8f983c023a","layer":"pei","quote":"秀即表诉被诬陷之由，论恺秽行，文辞（尤）〔亢〕厉。于时朝臣虽多证明，秀名誉由是而损","attribution":"裴注·荀绰《冀州记》","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aeaedf6f24d38daee210","start":145,"end":186,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
